<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Wednesday show that net currency reserves fell to about 102.9 billion marks in the week ending May 31 from about 103 billion in the week ending May 23.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    May 31	  May 23</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     118.5	   118.6</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.6	    15.6</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
